@base = http://localhost:8080
### Categories
GET {{base}}/api/categories
### Create; copy response id into ticketId
POST {{base}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Не работает принтер","description":"Кабинет 205","categoryId":1,"priority":"HIGH","dueAt":"2026-12-01T12:00:00Z"}

### Replace with created id
@ticketId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
### Edit
PUT {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Проверить питание","priority":"MEDIUM","dueAt":null}

### Start
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_PROGRESS"}

### Resolve
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"RESOLVED"}

### Forbidden reopen: 409
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_PROGRESS"}

### History
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/history
### Filter
GET {{base}}/api/tickets?status=NEW&priority=HIGH&page=0&size=20&overdue=true
### Report
GET {{base}}/api/reports/summary?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2027-01-01T00:00:00Z
